 403               
 404               /TTYPRT:        PRINTS CHAR IN AC ON TTY
 405               /       IGNORES NULLS
 406               /       PRINTS ^X ON CONTROL CHARS (EXCEPT CR, LF, FF, VT, TAB)
 407               /       PRINTS 'X ON LOWER CASE
 408               
 409               /HANDLES TABS CORRECTLY
