 415               /               AND CR/LF'S AT END OF LINE
 416               
 417               /TTYPCH:        IT USES TTYPRT TO PRINT CHAR BUT ALSO RESPONDS TO
 418               /               ^C, ^O, ^S, ^Q.
 419               /               IF ^Z IS BEING PRINTED, IT THEN STOPS FURTHER PRINTING
