 785                       0001            /BLOCK 1
 786                       HLT             /ERROR RETURN
 787                       JMS I (TTY      /CALL HANDLER AGAIN
 788                       4600            /OUTPUT SIX PAGES
 789                       1000
 790                       0001
 791                       HLT
 792                       CLA
 793                       JMP GO
 794                       >
 795                       $

